a limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"On ne doit pas se forcer à courir aux vitesses habituelles d'avant coupure sur ces premières sorties ! Regarde principalement le cardio et ton ressenti d'effort. Tu auras tout le temps de regarder tes données après la reprise.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.247813411078718,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"On reprends avec des durées de sortie très courte, pour se laisser le temps, te tracasse pas, tu seras vite de retour.\n","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"