 limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le mot d'ordre : relax ! Aller trop vite sur cette séance est contre-productif, ne tombe pas dans le piège ! A partir de la semaine prochaine on reprend les choses sérieuses, économise toi dès maintenant avant d'en faire trop.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30_5LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Dernières lignes droites de la reprise pour valider  que tout va bien quand on met de la vitesse. Comme ça, on reprend la semaine prochaine les fractionnés","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.140057023167604,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1500,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_50","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Toujours en contrôle, toujours facile. Si tu en fais déjà trop pendant la reprise, c'est mauvais signe pour la suite ! Les footings à allure lente c'est vraiment la base d'un entraînement efficace en endurance. Fais confiance au processus.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","