{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'envie d'accélérer sur les footings ? Elle est naturelle, on l'a tous car le footing c'est facile ! Mais il faut absolument te retenir de le faire si tu veux progresser ! Courir plus vite, c'est générer de la fatigue (même un peu) qui va t'empêcher d'être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci ! (je me répète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1790553600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Affutage_5_600_S3_HARD2","description":"Séance d'allure 5km avec pré-fatigue à S30. L'entrainement se distingue en 2 blocs. Un premier bloc de 4 fois 3' à S30 suivies par 1'30 de footing lent. Un second bloc de 8' à allure 5km sans pause. Entre ces 2 blocs, prends au moins 2' de récupération supplémentaire.","displayName":"S30 + Allure 5km","coachAdvice":"Sur cette dernière séance intense, l'intervalle à allure 5km est long, l'objectif est de prendre ses marques et de pousser à travers la fatigue pour montrer à ton cerveau que ça va bien se passer le jour J. Avec l'ambiance et l'adrénaline, tu trouveras pas peut être même plus simple le jour J !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":241,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1.5.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":90,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":150,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A5_8","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"5km","value":233,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"5km"},"durations":[{"value":480,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1790553600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":11.166500296853208,"expectedDuration":3510},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":90,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":150,"pace":{"value":596}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":480,"pace":{"value":233}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Cette fois, c'est sûr, le footing ça doit définitivement être devenu ta sortie la plus agréable ! Avec la forme qui monte tu dois te sentir pousser des ailes lors de tes footings non ? Si c'est le cas... retiens-toi, garde cette allure lente où tu es en total contrôle, on est pile dans la bonne zone de travail !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":6,"wee